Parameter:
  <User name>

Description:
  This command in used to send mail to another user. Mail is always
  personal and can only be read by the person being mailed to.

  If you enter a email-adress (eg 'calle@skom.se') instead of a
  username, a email is sent instead.
  
  If you enter a netmail-adress (such as totte@21:3/24), a netmail
  is sent instead.
